/**
 * Milky Way outlines for the night sky, as five brightness levels from faint to bright. Each level is a
 * list of closed polylines, and each polyline is a flat list of right ascension and declination pairs
 * (degrees). The night sky projects them for tonight, fills them very faintly, blurs the result and
 * masks it with noise, which is what gives the haze its patchy, dusty look.
 */
